@inherits LayoutComponentBase
@layout MainLayout

@*
    Mirrors InvoiceSoftware.Client/Pages/Account/ManageLayout.razor — the
    account section spans both projects (these pages are statically rendered),
    so the two layouts must stay in step or the section changes appearance
    halfway through.

    No heading and no nav here: the section nav is in the app sidebar, and each
    page supplies its own heading and cards its own content. Wrapping @Body in a
    card as well would double-border every page that already has one.
*@

<div class="space-y-6">
    @Body
</div>
